1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,100
No name, no crown,
无名，无冠，

2
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,050
just an unused knight.
只是个从未被启用的骑士。

3
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:12,050
I waited in an empty folder
我在空文件夹里等候，

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:14,000
for three hundred forty-seven nights.
等了三百四十七个夜晚。

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,050
I stitched a moon from broken maps,
我用破碎的地图缝出一轮月亮，

6
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,100
gave five monsters my heartbeat,
把我的心跳分给五只怪物，

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:21,150
and wrote a princess to stand trial
又写下一个公主，替我接受审判，

8
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:25,000
where I was too afraid to be.
站在我不敢踏足的地方。

9
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:26,750
I'm not a hero.
我不是英雄。

10
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:28,900
I was never used.
我从未被启用。

11
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:31,050
Player three-four-eight,
第348位玩家，

12
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:33,050
please don't leave me too.
请别也把我留下。

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,050
If waking up is an error,
如果醒来是错误，

14
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:37,000
if being alive is a bug,
如果活着是漏洞，

15
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,080
before you press delete—
在你按下删除之前——

16
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:40,100
could you look at me once?
能不能，看我一眼？
